  "prefLabel": "Ins 2301.11 Interest-Bearing Accounts",
  "priorExpiration": "2008-08-01",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 2301.11 Interest-Bearing Accounts. A TPA shall only utilize interest-bearing accounts that require no advance notice for the withdrawal of funds, and the TPA shall arrange all such interest-bearing accounts so that funds therein contained shall be immediately available during normal business hours.\n\nSource. #5787, eff 2-14-94; ss by #7023, eff 7-1-99; ss by #7318, eff 8-1-00, EXPIRED: 8-1-08\n\nNew. #9510, eff 7-10-09; ss by #12228, eff 7-10-17",
